    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Kokborok was recognized as an official state language of Tripura in 1979; Kokborok Day is celebrated on 19th January.",
        "Kharchi Puja involves the worship of 14 deities (Chaturdasa Devata) and is held annually at Puran Agartala.",
        "Hojagiri dance is performed exclusively by the Reang (Bru) tribe, requiring balancing props like earthen pitchers and lamps.",
        "Neermahal was commissioned in 1930 by Maharaja Bir Bikram Kishore Manikya Bahadur inside Rudrasagar Lake."
      ],
      "id": "nvq23mv"
